2. DATABASE TABLE CHECKLIST (NEON POSTGRES)
-------------------------------------------

Minimum tables required to support the PRD:

- users
- profiles
- colleges
- follows
- posts
- stories
- comments
- likes
- categories
- events
- groups
- group_members
- messages
- skills
- match_cards
- notifications
- reports
- roles
- user_roles

Each of these has corresponding columns defined in schema.sql and mapped in the ORM schema.


3. BACKEND ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES (.env.example)
-----------------------------------------------

Example keys stored in backend/.env.example:

NODE_ENV=
PORT=8080

DATABASE_URL=                 # Neon Postgres URL
REDIS_URL=                    # Redis URL

JWT_ACCESS_SECRET=
JWT_REFRESH_SECRET=
JWT_ACCESS_EXPIRES_IN=15m
JWT_REFRESH_EXPIRES_IN=7d

AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
AWS_REGION=
S3_BUCKET_PROFILE=
S3_BUCKET_POSTS=
S3_BUCKET_STORIES=

CLOUDFRONT_URL=
CLIENT_BASE_URL=
RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW_MS=60000
RATE_LIMIT_MAX=100


